    <node id="n6785">
      <data key="v_hash_id">summary-11ff2f0fd6fdf6f0d18f4da650b9e7b6</data>
      <data key="v_content">Sebagai seorang siswa dari sekolah kampung, saya merasa bangga atas prestasi yang telah dicapai oleh sekolah kampung tersebut. Meskipun tidak ada penghargaan atau hadiah yang diberikan secara langsung, namun prestasi ini telah memberikan kebanggaan tersendiri bagi keluarga saya. Saya berharap bahwa prestasi ini dapat menjadi inspirasi bagi para siswa kampung lainnya untuk terus bel</data>
      <data key="v_name">summary-11ff2f0fd6fdf6f0d18f4da650b9e7b6</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n6786">
      <data key="v_hash_id">summary-0d46e96454ec5ccc8a3619da906307f9</data>
      <data key="v_content">The text describes a school that is described as &quot;like no other&quot;. The school is located in Indonesia and is owned by PT Timah (Timah Corporation). It has been built with great care and attention to detail, surrounded by high fences symbolizing discipline and high-quality education. The school is also supported financially by PT Timah.
The school is described as being very wealthy, with hundreds of luxury cars parked outside and dozens of children from wealthy families enrolling. The school&apos;s location near a historic</data>
      <data key="v_name">summary-0d46e96454ec5ccc8a3619da906307f9</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n6787">
      <data key="v_hash_id">summary-9071405676d866ea1bd5a0ac510f2de1</data>
      <data key="v_content">The Karneval 17 August is an event that has great potential to boost school reputation due to its serious assessment. There were over 200 participants in this marching band, including colorful guards. Without a marching band at school, the carnival would lose its soul. &quot;Karneval&quot; is one way to show that our school still stands tall on Earth. Every student who participates in the marching band hasn&apos;t yet shown their best performance like they did before: The Best Performance award for</data>
      <data key="v_name">summary-9071405676d866ea1bd5a0ac510f2de1</data>
