      <data key="v_hash_id">summary-2ab475b39ce7d37ab3df6d73ed750621</data>
      <data key="v_content">This text describes a school with several notable features:

1. The main distinguishing feature is a bamboo flagpole and green signboard that stand out from the rest.
2. The classrooms are painted in bright colors with educational illustrations on them.
3. Each classroom has anatomical models, globes, whiteboards, and planetary model toys.
4. There&apos;s a first aid kit in each class.
5. A dedicated cleaner staff ensures cleanliness.
6. Classes can accommodate up to 40 students or</data>
