      <data key="v_hash_id">summary-476c23ea326b5061a5b24aa0dac2fdaa</data>
      <data key="v_content">Berikut adalah penjelasan singkat tentang konten yang diberikan:

1. Pesan utama:
   Pesan utama dari ayat-ayat tersebut adalah bahwa tidak ada jaminan atau kepastian dalam sistem pendidikan Indonesia. Meskipun beberapa sekolah negeri dapat menyewakan pakaian tradisional, tidak semua sekolah negeri memiliki fasilitas seperti itu.

2. Faktor-faktor yang mempengaruhi pend</data>
      <data key="v_name">summary-476c23ea326b5061a5b24aa0dac2fdaa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="n6794">
      <data key="v_hash_id">summary-3a91fa3c1c53a3b5d702aebfc170767b</data>
      <data key="v_content">The text discusses the challenges faced by schools in Indonesia and how they struggle to provide quality education despite limited resources. The author describes a school that has been facing issues such as leaking roofs, outdated facilities, and inadequate infrastructure. Despite these problems, the school still manages to offer basic amenities like libraries, canteens, and sports equipment. However, one major issue is the lack of access to clean water for students, which requires manual labor from unskilled workers. The author also mentions that some students</data>
